        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Len Wiseman, Kurt Wimmer, Mark Bomback, Philip K. Dick\n- Products: Underworld series, Live Free or Die Hard, Total Recall (1990 film), Total Recall (2012 film), We Can Remember It for You Wholesale\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer\n- Topics: film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Philip K. Dick wrote the 1966 short story \"We Can Remember It for You Wholesale.\"\n- The 1990 film Total Recall was inspired by Philip K. Dick's 1966 short story \"We Can Remember It for You Wholesale.\"\n- Len Ryan Wiseman was born on March 4, 1973, and he is an American film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Len Wiseman is best known for his work on the Underworld series, Live Free or Die Hard, and the 2012 film Total Recall.\n- Total Recall is a 2012 American science-fiction action film directed by Len Wiseman.\n- Kurt Wimmer and Mark Bomback wrote the screenplay for the 2012 film Total Recall.\n- The screenplay for the 2012 film Total Recall was based on the 1990 film of the same name.",
